          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="left" style="padding:24px 32px 8px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="background:#7466F1;border-radius:8px;">
                    <a href="{{app_url}}/dashboard" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 24px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">
                      Make a song now
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding:8px 32px 0;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;">
                If something got in the way &mdash; sign-in, credits, a prompt that produced nothing useful
